    board: file CF-251 — cf-node missing from the fleet repo-scope manifest
    
    Measured 2026-11-05: the dispatcher's own job tests print
    'fleet-gh-scope: no scoped token for cf-node (agent cf-node is not in the
    manifest)'. fleet-repo-scope.json names 12 agents and cf-node is not one of
    them, so a node job that needs GitHub is refused before it starts. Found while
    scanning the crier/code-factory integration surface; not previously filed.
